# Bright Dreamers Club — Design System

Apply on every page/section. Site is plain HTML + CSS + jQuery (later WordPress). No Tailwind / npm build.

## Container

- Content sits in `.site-container` (max-width via `--container-max-width` 1650px, padding via `--container-padding` 72px desktop / 32px tablet / 20px mobile).
- Sections may be full-bleed; text/cards/images stay inside the container.
- Do not redefine container per page.

## Layout

- No large empty center gaps. Fill width with images/visuals — never by enlarging text/buttons past readable size.
- Consistent section vertical padding via `.section-padding` / `--section-pad-y` (~90px desktop, scales down).

## Typography

- Headings (h1–h6): Bitter (`--font-heading`)
- Body, nav, buttons, small text: Outfit (`--font-body`)
- Never mix. Fonts load from `includes/header.html`.

## Hero

- Entire hero (heading, text, buttons, image) must fit in the first viewport on ~900px desktop height — no scroll to see hero content.

## Responsive grids

- Multi-card / icon grids that don’t fit one row on tablet/mobile → horizontal swipe slider, not wrapped multi-row grid.
- Simple sections (hero, text+image) stack normally — no slider.

## Cards & color

- Card shadow: `.card-shadow` / `--card-shadow` → `rgba(99, 99, 99, 0.2) 0px 2px 8px 0px`
- Brand colors only via CSS variables: `--color-pink` `#EE1D78`, `--color-navy` `#001B66`. New colors → add to `:root` in `style.css`, never raw hex in HTML.

## Motion

- Nav hover: underline slide ~0.2–0.3s ease (`.nav-link`)
- Buttons: subtle hover scale ~1.03–1.05 (`.btn-hover`)
- Soft, warm, kid-friendly on-load section animations — never jarring

## DevTools / inspect

- Prefer CSS variables on `:root` and shared classes so values can be tweaked in inspect.
- Avoid one-off inline styles and hardcoded values that can’t be adjusted from the stylesheet.
